Description: Browse: fixed sources instead of the file system tree
 DECKSMITHOS_BROWSE_SOURCES="LABEL=/path:LABEL2=/path2" turns the Computer
 feature into "Sources": only these folders at the top (no Quick Links,
 Removable Devices or /), each shown only while it is on a file system other
 than the root one, i.e. while a drive is mounted there. Checked every 2 s;
 a drive that goes away also clears its file list. The root page explains
 the sources. No context menu then. Without the variable nothing changes.
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-22
